{"id":9218,"date":"2017-11-27T00:00:00","date_gmt":"2017-11-27T07:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkfirst.com\/resources\/terminating-employees-best-practices-and-red-flags-to-consider\/"},"modified":"2024-12-27T18:36:54","modified_gmt":"2024-12-27T23:36:54","slug":"terminating-employees-best-practices-and-red-flags-to-consider","status":"publish","type":"resources","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/terminating-employees-best-practices-and-red-flags-to-consider\/","title":{"rendered":"Terminating Employees: Best Practices and Red Flags To Consider"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Did you know it\u2019s best practice to prepare for your next termination during the hiring process?<\/p>\n<p>Take a look at our latest installment published on Behavioral Science in the 21st Century (bSci21) <strong>discussing\u00a0best practices &amp; red flags to consider when terminating employees!<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Terminating an employee is an interesting time for the entire office and can affect <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/our-solutions\/practice-management\/\">productivity<\/a> and culture.<\/p>\n<p>Read the full article <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/webinar-terminating-employees-best-practices-and-red-flags-to-consider\/\">[Webinar] Terminating Employees: Best Practices and Red Flags to Consider<\/a>\u00a0to discover how to <strong>avoid termination problems at the point of hire\u00a0<\/strong>and understand stipulations such as\u00a0<strong>\u201cemployment at will\u201d!<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>RethinkBH and bSci21 publish a new article every month, stay tuned for the next installment!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":22763,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"Best Practices and Red Flags When Terminating Employees","_seopress_titles_desc":"Terminating employees can affect productivity and culture. Learn how to avoid probl